if we want to use these admonitions for the class reference, we should look into creating new directives in Sphinx to have inline styling similar to the editor's. So instead of `.. note::` we could use something like `.. classref_note::`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3549006712/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3549084762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-3549084762","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":3549084762,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Tirxa","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T18:44:35Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T18:58:12Z","body":"I had a quick look [at the CSS for important admonitions](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/blob/700efb28f790c6148d0d71c340139a5feaea45aa/_static/css/custom.css#L1197-L1207), so that's the reason, although it is very strange.\r\n\r\nFor reference, I found an `.. important::` admonition on the [C++ modules pages](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/architecture/custom_modules_in_cpp.html#creating-a-new-module), which is, as expected, the wrong color. There are also a few in [Binding to external libraries](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine_details/architecture/binding_to_external_libraries.html), among others.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3549084762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3549322080","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-3549322080","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":3549322080,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Tjltg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T19:49:31Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T19:49:31Z","body":"> I had a quick look [at the CSS for important admonitions](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/blob/700efb28f790c6148d0d71c340139a5feaea45aa/_static/css/custom.css#L1197-L1207), so that's the reason, although it is very strange.\r\n\r\nThis was added in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/commit/9e8fb108cc5f27bbd0f2cf9e1bd8e31e121294c2, so spiderman meme for you @HugoLocurcio :P\r\nIt was probably an oversight.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3549322080/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3550034177","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-3550034177","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":3550034177,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TmTkB","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-19T00:31:59Z","updated_at":"2025-11-19T00:31:59Z","body":"> my main worry is how visible and big the Sphinx admonitions are.\r\n\r\nI remember how @Ivorforce was also peeved at this. The admonitions in the docs _can_ be quite distracting and ruin the reading flow. Sometimes they look even more important than the main text. Whether that's intentional or not, writers may not be aware of this. As you said, they are \"ok\", but there may be room of improvement.\r\n\r\nAt the same time, it is also true that the class reference _abuses_ admonitions far too much and improperly, but I wouldn't know where to even begin with that...","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3550034177/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3803767271","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-3803767271","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":3803767271,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7iuOHn","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"h