ove, it doesn't actually change the class reference and only adds _support_ for the admonitions.\r\nBut in practice it would make sense to finish it up by addressing the pain point brought up by Akien in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-3549006712 as soon as possible.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4530305441/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4531821322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-4531821322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":4531821322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDh4bCg","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T05:35:23Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T05:38:00Z","body":"I went ahead and added the `classref_` prefix suggested by Rémi to admonitions. There will need to be a godot-docs PR to add CSS for those then; which reminds me, [the `important` admonition is still using the `tip` color](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-3549084762) instead of the likely more appropriate `warning`.\r\n\r\nAs it stands, this PR only applies the `[note]` admonition to the array copy note, everything else in the class reference stays with **Note:** and similar bold messages, and can be considered for upgrade using the regex I proposed in the PR description.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4531821322/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4547015247","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-4547015247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":4547015247,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDwXyTw","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-26T17:42:02Z","updated_at":"2026-05-26T17:42:02Z","body":"I opened godotengine/godot-docs#12017 to add support for the new `.. classref_note::` rST directive (and corresponding directives for important, tip, warning). Once that PR is merged, this one can safely be merged as well with the copy array note being properly supported. After that, another PR can handle converting all existing occurrences to the new format.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4547015247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4552257544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-4552257544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":4552257544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABD1XwCA","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-27T07:08:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-27T07:08:13Z","body":"Refactored to remove code duplication between the 4 tags.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4552257544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4624532915","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-4624532915","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":4624532915,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABE6TFsw","user":{"login":"mhilbrunner","id":1654763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQ3NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1654763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner","html_url":"https://github.com/mhilbrunner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-04T17:19:57Z","updated_at":"2026-06-04T17:27:32Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot-docs/pull/12017 is good to go on the documentation repo. If a decision is made to merge this, please merge that first.\r\n\r\nI'm a bit hesitant to add more complexity to `make_rst.py` and our various markup formats, which is already somewhat unwieldy and complex (at the same time, this only adds a few fairly self contained lines, and not that much complexity), and for admonitions, which we already IMO overuse on the documentation. They're also more nonstandard tags that needs to be implemented and parsed by docs, the editor and all others tools that ever want to consume our docs. I wonder if we instead should just style `[b]Note:[/b]` & friends the same way. But then, this is definitely more semantic, and none of these points is a huge issue (to me).\r\n\r\nAt the same time, these look nice and are IMO a improvement over the status quo.\r\n\r\nOverall, I have no strong opinion either way and am fine with this being merged. :)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4624532915/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4757202666","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#issuecomment-4757202666","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111375","id":4757202666,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABG40m6g","user":{"login":"Cykyrios","id":53737317,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzM3MzE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53737317?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios","html_url":"https://github.com/Cykyrios","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cykyrios